{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00106","headline":"谒大慈恩寺 · 高宗皇帝","name":"谒大慈恩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日宫开万仞，月殿耸千寻。\n花盖飞团影，幡虹曳曲阴。\n绮霞遥笼帐，丛珠细网林。\n寥廓烟云表，超然物外心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}